{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50251","headline":"严尚书重浚横泉井 · 李翔","name":"严尚书重浚横泉井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古甃千寻锁绿苔，老蛟曾遯（遁）此中来。\n厌聆羽客提锋入，喜见将军杖（仗）节开。\n玉液洞通甘似醴，金瓶轮下殷如雷，更闻堪疗羣生疾，愿倚崇栏饮一杯。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}